#: features.js:769
msgid ""
"Answer five quick questions and I'll build a focus setup that fits how you "
"work — your rhythm, sounds, breaks and the help you need. You can fine-tune "
"everything later in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Beş kısa soruyu yanıtla, çalışma şekline uygun bir odak kurulumu "
